    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73898" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμο-φροσύνη</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμόνοια</span>
			, <i>unity of mind and feeling,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμοφροσύνην ὀπάσειαν ἐσθλὴν [θεοί]</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					6.181
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>A.</u>
				353
			</span></i> : pl., <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				15.198
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.716
			</span></i> : also in 
				Ion.
			 and later Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Democr.
				186
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				9.45
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ocell.
				4.6
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
